# local paste-copy of Code.gs for the Apps Script editor (source of truth is apps-script/Code.gs)
# Code-gs-copy.txt — REMOVED 2026-07-29, and do not recreate it.
# It sat here six releases stale (1,133 lines vs 2,103) with no CODE_VERSION,
# no CODE_SCHEMA, no restoreBackup, no rejectHandover — and being gitignored is
# exactly what made it dangerous: invisible to git status, under a name that
# says "paste this in", with nothing to ever tell you it had drifted. Pasting it
# would have silently switched off the whole version-drift machinery, so every
# phone would report green while talking to a six-release-old backend.
# If you want a paste buffer:  cp apps-script/Code.gs /tmp/
